# Derived data stays out of the repo.
#
# train/ is a free, deterministic re-render: `go run ./datasets/state-tuning/render`
# with the same --seed reproduces it byte for byte from semantic/.
# collected/ is a teacher QC pass; its findings belong in commit messages and in
# the `audit` field of the affected case, not as a committed transcript.
#
# semantic/ is the actual source and stays tracked.
collected/
train/
